### Tone: End-of-game award: Hindsight, the player who called "higher or lower than my answer" right most often.
### $count: right calls (≥ 3). They knew which way they were wrong; mock the self-knowledge, admire it grudgingly.

award-hindsight-1 =
    The Hindsight award goes to { $name }, who called it { $count } times. You knew you were wrong. You just didn’t know how wrong.
award-hindsight-2 = { $name }, you guessed which way your own guesses were wrong. That’s either wisdom or a very specific kind of doubt.
award-hindsight-3 = Hindsight: { $name }. Excellent at predicting your mistakes. Less excellent at avoiding them.
award-hindsight-4 =
    { $name }: { $count } correct calls. If only you’d answered the way you called, you might have won.
award-hindsight-5 = The award for knowing yourself goes to { $name }. Know thyself, said the philosophers. They didn’t mention estimating.
award-hindsight-6 = { $name } could always tell which side of the truth they’d landed on. A gift. A useless, beautiful gift.
award-hindsight-7 = Hindsight: { $name }. Twenty-twenty, they say. Your answers, however, were a little blurry.
award-hindsight-8 =
    { $count } times, { $name } correctly predicted their own error. I’ve recommended you for a job in quality control. Your own.
award-hindsight-9 = The Hindsight goes to { $name }, who knew which way the truth was, and still didn’t write it down.
award-hindsight-10 = { $name }, the best judge of your own estimates. Next time, try being the judge before you answer.
award-hindsight-11 = { $name } called their own mistakes { $count } times. Self-awareness: excellent. Self-correction: pending.
award-hindsight-12 = Hindsight: { $name }. You always knew which way you were wrong. The rest of them had to wait for the reveal.
award-hindsight-13 = The Hindsight goes to { $name }. You could see the truth from where you were standing. You just stood still.
award-hindsight-14 = { $name }, { $count } right calls. A better forecaster than estimator. Have you considered weather?
award-hindsight-15 = Hindsight: { $name }. Too high, you said. And it was. Then why did you write it?
